       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     TEAUNAVA.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   04/06/88.
       DATE-COMPILED.
     0*INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *SECURITY.
      *REMARKS.
      *****************************************************************
      *    THIS PROGRAMS CHANGES REQS QUEUED FROM 1 APPROVER TO ANOTHER
      *    APPROVER DUES TO VACATION, TRAVELLING OR SICKNESS.
      *****************************************************************

      *****************************************************************
      **          M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
      *C MAR 10, 2005  D.RAUCH       DCR01    REQUEST# 2005-78515
      *C    DISPLAY FILE PROCESSING CHANGED FROM USING ZCSISINQ
      *C    NEW DISPLAY FILE ZTEAUNAVA CREATED - FORMATS COPIED
      *C    FROM ZCSISINQ.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
      *C MMM DD, CCYY  XXXNAMEXXX    XXX01    REQUEST# 2005-XXXXX
      *C    XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX DESC XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
      *****************************************************************


       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
DCR01             ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZTEAUNAVA-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DSPLY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT MEMPL
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSPLY-REC          PIC X(2000).

       FD  MEMPL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MEMPL-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS4200  OF MCFLCS4201.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  ALL-LEVELS                    PIC XX.

       01  BASE-MMISA                    PIC X(24) VALUE "  MMISA;".

       COPY CATREAD    IN COPYLIB.

       COPY CPYIND     IN COPYLIB.

       01  DSPLY-STATUS                  PIC XX.

       01  FILE-STATUS                   PIC XX.

       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.

       COPY LANGSUB    IN COPYLIB.

       COPY MEMPL      IN COPYLIB.

       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER                PIC X(80).

       01  OLD-LEVEL                     PIC XX.

       01  SCREEN-INPUT.
           05  OLD-APPROVER              PIC X(4).
           05  NEW-APPROVER              PIC X(4).
           05  MESSAGE-LINE              PIC X(79).
           05  ERROR-LINE                PIC X(79).

       COPY WSCONTROL  IN COPYLIB.

      ******************************************************************
      **                                                              **
      **          S U B P R O G R A M   A R E A S                     **
      **                                                              **
      ******************************************************************

       COPY CEAUPEMP   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY SEAUSEIQ   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.

       COPY TSHWRDFM   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY VCOMAREA   IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **           D A T A B A S E   W O R K                     **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************

       01  BASE                          PIC X(10) VALUE "  STORES;".
       01  PASSWORD                      PIC X(5)  VALUE "JADE;".

       COPY DBSTAT     IN COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       0000-START.
           MOVE "AL"        TO ALL-LEVELS.
           OPEN I-O   DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT MEMPL.
           MOVE SPACES      TO DSPLY-REC.
           MOVE "FEAUNAVA"  TO VIEW-CFNAME.
           PERFORM 6000-MAIN THRU 6990-MAIN-X.
           CLOSE MEMPL.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE.
           GOBACK.

       2100-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "TEAUNAVA"                TO   BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE BU-PGM-NAME STATUS-AREA
             DUMMY-VIEW-AREA, DUMMY-KSAM-STAT BU-DISPLAY-MSG
             BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       6000-MAIN.
           PERFORM 99-SCREEN-WRITE.
           PERFORM 98-SCREEN-READ.
           MOVE DSPLY-REC TO SCREEN-INPUT.
           MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER,
                          ERROR-LINE.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3 GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.
020300     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 7
020400         CALL "SEAUSEIQ" USING     BASE,
020500                                   BASE-MMISA,
020600                                   VIEW-COMAREA,
020700                                   SRF-COMAREA,
020800                                   LANGUAGE-PARMS,
020900                                   EAUSE-PARMS
021000         IF EAUSE-RETURNED-EMPL = SPACES
021400             GO TO 6000-MAIN
021500         ELSE
021800         MOVE EAUSE-RETURNED-EMPL TO NEW-APPROVER
022000         GO TO 6000-MAIN.
022100
           MOVE OLD-APPROVER TO EMPLOYID OF MEMPL-REC.
           READ MEMPL INTO BUF-MEMPL
               INVALID KEY    MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
      *M          "E17: EMPLOYEE-ID DOES NOT EXIST"
                   MOVE  5 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 17 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE "1" TO INDS (1) INDS (99)
                   MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERROR-LINE
                   MOVE SCREEN-INPUT   TO DSPLY-REC
                   GO TO 6000-MAIN
               ELSE
               MOVE "CANNOT RETRIEVE MEMPL RECORD "
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
           MOVE MEMPL-LEVEL TO OLD-LEVEL.

           MOVE NEW-APPROVER TO EMPLOYID OF MEMPL-REC.
           READ MEMPL INTO BUF-MEMPL
               INVALID KEY    MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
      *M          "E17: EMPLOYEE-ID DOES NOT EXIST"
                   MOVE  5 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 17 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE "1" TO INDS (2) INDS (99)
                   MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERROR-LINE
                   MOVE SCREEN-INPUT   TO DSPLY-REC
                   GO TO 6000-MAIN
               ELSE
               MOVE "CANNOT RETRIEVE MEMPL RECORD "
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

      *M---USER MUST HAVE APPROVE REQ CAPABILITY TO BE A LEGITIMATE
      *M---ALTERNATE APPROVER
           IF MEMPL-APP-RQ-FLAG NOT = "Y"
      *M       "E100: EMPLOYEE DOES NOT HAVE APPROVAL CAPABILITY"
               MOVE   5 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE 100 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE "1" TO INDS (2) INDS (99)
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERROR-LINE
               MOVE SCREEN-INPUT   TO DSPLY-REC
               GO TO 6000-MAIN.

      *------ CHANGE THE OLD EMPLOYEE TO INACTIVE.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO   CEAUPEMP-PARMS.
           MOVE OLD-APPROVER             TO   CEAU-EMPL.
           MOVE "Y"                      TO   CEAU-OLD-ACTIVE.
           MOVE "N"                      TO   CEAU-CURRENT-ACTIVE.
           MOVE OLD-LEVEL                TO   CEAU-OLD-LEVEL,
                                              CEAU-CURRENT-LEVEL.
           MOVE "Y"                      TO   CEAU-UPDATE-MEMPL-FLAG.
           CALL "CEAUPEMP" USING BASE, STATUS-AREA, CEAUPEMP-PARMS,
             BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
           IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1 NOT = SPACES
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

      *------ CHANGE THE NEW EMPLOYEE TO ACTIVE, BUT ALSO LEAVE HIM
      *------ ACTIVE AT HIS OLD LEVEL.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO   CEAUPEMP-PARMS.
           MOVE NEW-APPROVER             TO   CEAU-EMPL.
           MOVE "N"                      TO   CEAU-OLD-ACTIVE.
           MOVE "Y"                      TO   CEAU-CURRENT-ACTIVE.
           MOVE MEMPL-LEVEL              TO   CEAU-OLD-LEVEL,
                                              CEAU-CURRENT-LEVEL.
           CALL "CEAUPEMP" USING BASE, STATUS-AREA, CEAUPEMP-PARMS,
             BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
           IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1 NOT = SPACES
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

      *------ NOW CHANGE ALL UNAPPROVED REQS IN EMPL'S QUEUE TO THE
      *------ ALTERNATE EMPL.
           CALL "CEAQCHG" USING BASE, STATUS-AREA, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
             OLD-APPROVER, NEW-APPROVER, ALL-LEVELS.
           IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1 NOT = SPACES
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       6990-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

       98-SCREEN-READ.
           READ DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-CFNAME
               INDIC IS INDICS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO INDICS.
           IF DSPLY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
           MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.

       99-SCREEN-WRITE.
           WRITE DSPLY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-CFNAME
               INDIC IS INDICS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO INDICS.

       999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
030100     EXIT.
